'''The Gates of Aku''' is the only stage in '''Unleashing the Cats''', which appears after clearing all three "Wicked" maps: [[Wicked Cat]], [[Wicked Tank]] and [[Wicked Axe]]. Once cleared, it disappears permanently. It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

Despite having no rewards of its own, beating this stage is required to access [[The Aku Realms]], [[Imminent Disaster]] and most other stages that feature the [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]] base, which is indicated by the message "Aku Altars Appear! Your Aku Research is complete and the Gates of Aku have opened! Visit Empire of Cats to enter this dark realm..."

