==Battleground==
*1 [[Wicked Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Cat]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Wicked Tank Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Tank Cat]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Wicked Axe Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Axe Cat]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Let Wicked Cat get close to your base, then attack it with long-ranged attackers such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] and [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]], all the while spamming [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Macho Cats]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cats]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cats]]. If you still can't win, use a [[Battle Items#Rich Cat|Rich Cat]].

