==Trivia==
*Unleashing the Cats is the first event stage to have no time limit, the only others being [[Valkyrie Cat's Trial]], [[Growing Catfruit]] and [[Bahamut Cat's Trial]].
*Within the game's code, Unleashing the Cats actually has two stages, however the second stage is an inaccessible duplicate of [[Taking the Stage (Insane)]].

